    "text": {
     "en": "Weather is the day-to-day condition of the atmosphere: temperature, rain, wind, humidity and cloud.\nWe measure temperature with a thermometer, rainfall with a rain gauge and wind direction with a wind vane. Satellites and weather stations send data to forecasters.\nForecasts help farmers, fishermen and travellers plan and stay safe."
    }
